SCOPE — THIS NOTICE DOES NOT GRANT RIGHTS OVER THE SOURCE TEXTS.

The reservation above covers Al Marfa Technologies' own work. It confers no
rights over, and does not extend to, the Qur'anic text, the translations, or the
fonts this pipeline compiles. Those belong to their respective rights holders and
carry their own, mostly narrower terms — several are non-commercial,
attribution-required and verbatim-only, and one (Junagarhi) is public domain and
therefore cannot be claimed by anyone, including us.

ATTRIBUTION.md is canonical for what may be redistributed and under what
obligations; config/sources.yaml records the terms per resource (the `license`
field, which is compiled into the database and its published edition artifacts).
